# Pull and benchmark run logs. Timestamped, noisy in diffs, and regenerable by
# re-running the script that wrote them. The measured data (results/*.tsv and
# the tables in the documents) is committed instead — same convention as
# ../ollamaClaudeCode_v1 and ../ollamaClaudeCode_v2.
*.log
*.log.done
results/*.log
results/*.log.done
